orously tested to ensure safety for daily use. The interior does not retain flavors or odors, so every refill is as pure as the first. Unlike plastic bottles, our stainless steel material is free from harmful chemicals, ensuring your drinks stay fresh and uncontaminated. The food-safe, BPA-free lid with a silicone gasket prevents leaks and spills, making it easy to carry in bags or backpacks without worry.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>Designed for Global Appeal</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">We understand that international shoppers seek products that combine style and practicality. The EcoPure Water Bottle is available in a range of fashionable colors and sizes, from a compact 350ml version for kids to a large 1L bottle for athletes. Custom logo printing offers additional branding opportunities for corporate gifts or promotional campaigns.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Through our dedicated e-commerce platform, we provide seamless purchasing experiences for customers around the globe. With multilingual customer service, secure payment options, and worldwide shipping, international buyers can easily enjoy the EcoPure difference.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>Easy Care and Maintenance</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Maintaining your EcoPure Water Bottle is effortless. The wide mouth design allows for easy handwashing, and the bottle is dishwasher-safe for added convenience. Each purchase includes a detailed care guide to ensure optimal bottle longevity and hygiene.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>Commitment to Social Responsibility</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">EcoPure is not only invested in environmental sustainability but also in making a positive social impact. A portion of our profits supports clean water initiatives in underserved communities. By purchasing an EcoPure Water Bottle, customers contribute to safe drinking water projects worldwide.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>Endorsements and Customer Reviews</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">The EcoPure Water Bottle has already gained positive reviews from outdoor enthusiasts, athletes, students, and families. Customers praise its ability to keep drinks at the perfect temperature, its lightweight portability, and the stylish designs that suit every personality.</p>', '$158.00', '0', '2025-04-24 10:42:25.275677', 0, 3, 45, 'Discover a perfect blend of quality, innovation, and value with our latest product, designed to enhance your daily life. Carefully crafted using premium materials, it offers outstanding performance, reliability, and durability. Its user-friendly features ensure easy operation for both beginners and experts, making it an ideal choice for homes, offices, and on-the-go lifestyles. The contemporary design seamlessly integrates with any environment.', 'Test Active Venture', 'test', 'Test Active Venture', '[{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"19cm\"},{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"0.25kg\"},{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Light\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (42, 'SALOMON XT-6 - Glacier White', '1761646627884.jpg#1761646797303.jpg#1761646800461.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The SALOMON XT-6 features a foot-hugging construction combined with SensiFit™ technology, which wraps the foot securely for precise support and stability during movement. The upper is made from breathable mesh and abrasion-resistant synthetic leather, offering a lightweight and durable build that adapts to varied terrains. The midsole incorporates the advanced ACS (Advanced Chassis System) for effective shock absorption and enhanced responsiveness. Paired with a Contagrip® outsole for superior traction, it ensures steady performance on wet rocks or rugged trails.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>Color Inspiration &amp; Design Aesthetics</strong><br>Inspired by polar glaciers, the \"Glacier White\" colorway uses an all-white design to symbolize the purity and energy of ice and snow, accented by subtle brand logos for a minimalist yet premium look. The sleek lines and layered structure of the shoe create a versatile style that elevates any outfit, from sportswear to casual wear.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>All-Terrain Performance &amp; Wearing Scenarios</strong><br>The XT-6 is not only built for professional outdoor activities like mountain hiking and trail running but is also favored by urban fashion lovers for its stylish appearance. The lightweight design reduces burden during long wear, and the quick lace system allows for easy adjustment, making it perfect for seamless transitions from outdoor adventures to city life.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>Eco-Conscious Approach &amp; Sustainable Design</strong><br>SALOMON is committed to integrating environmental responsibility into its products. Parts of this shoe\'s upper utilize recycled materials, and the brand continuously optimizes manufacturing processes to reduce environmental impact. We encourage consumers to choose durable, high-performance products as an alternative to fast fashion, contributing together to a more sustainable future.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>Globally Recognized &amp; Recommended</strong><br>The SALOMON XT-6 series has earned recognition from outdoor enthusiasts, trendsetters, and professional athletes worldwide. Its outstanding all-around performance and appealing design consistently receive high praise. Whether for long-distance running, weekend hikes, or everyday outings, it is a reliable companion you can count on.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-11 00:31:47.611307', 0, 3, 50, 'Master the balance of function and style with the SALOMON XT-6 ADV in Glacier White. Featuring a seamless white design inspired by glacial landscapes, these shoes combine high-performance materials with all-terrain capability. Crafted with breathable mesh and durable synthetic leather, they deliver reliable support and comfort for trails or city streets. The versatile silhouette adapts to both outdoor adventures and urban wear, making them the perfect choice for active lifestyles.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 \'Glacier White\' trail shoes with SensiFit technology, Contagrip outsole and advanced cushioning. Ideal for trail running, hiking and urban wear. Shop now!', 'SALOMON,XT-6,outdoor Sports,Mesh Fabric Synthetic Leather,Low Top Running Shoes,Glacier White', 'SALOMON XT-6 Outdoor Sports Mesh Fabric Synthetic Leather Low-Top Running Shoes - Glacier White', '[{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"378g per piece\"},{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"White\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"19cm\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (47, 'SALOMON XT-6 Vanilla', '1761646810355.jpg#1761646813223.jpg#1761646815830.jpg#1761646817919.jpg#1761646820009.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Salomon XT-6 retains its signature streamlined, low-top profile. The clever letter print and color-blocking in vanilla and beige tones create visual depth and a premium feel. The upper combines breathable mesh with durable synthetic leather, offering support and resilience in key areas.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">While designed for casual and training use, the XT-6 inherits professional outdoor technologies. The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system to the midfoot, providing a precise, secure fit during movement. The Advanced Chassis (ACS) offers reliable stability and cushioning for comfortable strides. Paired with Contagrip® outsole technology, it delivers superior traction and control on park trails, in the gym, or on city pavements.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Its versatility allows you to transition effortlessly from trails to streets. The quick lace system ensures easy wearability, and the unisex design caters to diverse style preferences.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-21 14:17:35.726384', 0, 3, 50, 'This SALOMON XT-6 in Vanilla seamlessly bridges outdoor performance with urban style. Its minimalist color-blocked design exudes a casual, fashion-forward vibe. Crafted from a blend of fabric and premium synthetic leather, it ensures lightweight comfort and flexible movement. Ideal for light trail training, daily city commuting, or personal style expression, it\'s an essential and versatile sneaker for the modern lifestyle.', 'Meet the SALOMON XT-6 in Vanilla. These color-blocked sneakers blend trail-ready tech like SensiFit and Contagrip grip with urban style. Perfect for city life and light trails.', 'SALOMON XT-6 Vanilla, color block sneakers, casual trail shoes, unisex lifestyle sneakers, urban hiking shoes, SensiFit, daily trainer, fashion athletic wear', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Vanilla\' Color-Blocking - Unisex Casual Trail Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"330g per piece\"},{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Vanilla\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"19cm\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (48, 'SALOMON XT-6 Black & Dark Shadow', '1761646834253.jpg#1761646838199.jpg#1761646840797.jpg#1761646843275.jpg#1761646845736.jpg', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;\">The SALOMON XT-6 is renowned for its highly recognizable, streamlined low-top silhouette. This deep Black &amp; Dark Shadow colorway creates a minimalist yet layered visual effect, exuding a sophisticated and understated aesthetic. The upper combines breathable mesh with wear-resistant synthetic leather, providing extra protection in critical zones and ensuring the shoe remains lightweight and durable for the long term.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;\">Despite its stylish look, the XT-6 is built on SALOMON\'s professional outdoor DNA. The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system towards the midsole, offering a secure, glove-like fit that feels custom-made for your foot during movement. The lightweight and durable Advanced Chassis System (ACS) provides reliable stability and effective shock absorption. The outsole utilizes the renowned Contagrip® rubber compound with a unique tread pattern, delivering superior traction and slip resistance on everything from wet city pavements to rugged mountain trails.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;\">The shoe is equipped with the Quicklace® quick-pull system for effortless wearability and micro-adjustment, while a dedicated lace pocket on the tongue securely stores the excess, preventing snags. The molded OrthoLite® sockliner enhances underfoot comfort, breathability, and long-term durability. Seamlessly transitioning from professional trail running to city sidewalks, the XT-6 is perfectly suited for a wide range of style choices and activity scenarios.</span></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-22 20:40:57.306255', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Black & Dark Shadow seamlessly blends rugged outdoor performance with urban style. Its durable mesh and synthetic leather upper provides support and breathability, while core technologies like SensiFit™ and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) ensure stability on any terrain. A versatile and dependable companion for trail runs or city streets.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Black & Dark Shadow. These durable sneakers feature a mesh and leather upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and a Contagrip® outsole for all-terrain traction. Ideal for trail', 'SALOMON XT-6, Black trail running shoes, unisex outdoor sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, urban hiking shoes, Salomon XT-6 Black', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Black Dark Shadow\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"365g/per piece\"},{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"19cm\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (49, 'SALOMON XT-6 Black Grey Blue', '1761646514873.jpg#1761646518161.jpg#1761646520560.jpg#1761646523019.jpg#1761646533944.jpg', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">The SALOMON XT-6 in Black Grey Blue skillfully blends outdoor performance with urban style. The upper, made of abrasion-resistant mesh and synthetic materials, offers excellent durability and support. Equipped with core technologies like SensiFit™ for a precise fit, an ACS chassis for stability, and a Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction, it ensures confident movement on varied terrain. The classic low-top, streamlined design makes it a perfect choice for both trail running and everyday urban wear.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Design &amp; Materials</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top silhouette. The black, grey, and blue are cleverly color-blocked, creating a versatile and layered look. The upper combines high-strength breathable mesh with wear-resistant synthetic leather, providing extra support in critical zones and ensuring lightweight durability.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Core Performance Technologies</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system to the midfoot, delivering a secure, snug, and comfortable fit during activity. The lightweight and durable Advanced Chassis System (ACS) enhances stability and shock absorption. The Mud Contagrip® outsole, with its unique lug pattern, offers superior grip and slip resistance on wet or rugged terrain.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>User-Centric Details &amp; Versatility</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The shoe features a </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Quicklace® quick-pull system</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> for easy wearability and adjustment, complemented by a lace pocket on the tongue to secure the ends. The molded </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>OrthoLite®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> sockliner improves cushioning, breathability, and underfoot comfort. Ready for trail running, city commuting, or casual style, the XT-6 is an ideal companion for a dynamic lifestyle, thanks to its all-terrain capability and trendy design.</span></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-22 21:01:23.783105', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Dark Grey merges an iconic design with versatile performance. Its breathable mesh and synthetic upper, combined with SensiFit™, ACS stabilization, and a Contagrip® outsole, deliver a precise fit and reliable traction. Featuring a Quicklace® system and OrthoLite® insole, it\'s built for all-day comfort on trails or city streets.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Black Grey Blue–featuring a durable mesh and synthetic upper, SensiFit™ for a precise fit, ACS cushioning, and Contagrip® traction. Perfect for trail running and city life.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Black Grey Blue trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, durable mesh shoes, urban outdoor footwear', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Black Grey Blue\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Blue\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (50, 'SALOMON XT-6 White', '1761646435509.jpg#1761646443549.jpg#1761646455828.jpg', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Waterproof &amp; Materials</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The upper utilizes a </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>GORE-TEX</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> laminate, offering protection against rain while maintaining good breathability for lasting comfort. It combines a highly durable TPU film with breathable mesh, and features anti-debris mesh and a reinforced toe cap for lightweight durability.<br><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Cushion &amp; Stability</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The midsole incorporates </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>ENERGYCELL+</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> cushioning technology for effective shock absorption. The </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>ACS (Agile Chassis System)</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> provides reliable stability and support. The </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Contagrip®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> rubber outsole, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior traction and slip resistance on wet or rugged terrain.<br><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Fit &amp; Comfort</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>SensiFit™</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a precise, glove-like fit. The </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Quicklace®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure; a lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the cord ends. The molded </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>OrthoLite®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> sockliner enhances cushioning, breathability, and overall underfoot comfort for extended wear.</span></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-22 21:15:12.970291', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in White masterfully blends professional outdoor performance with urban aesthetics. The upper features GORE-TEX technology for all-weather dryness and excellent breathability. Equipped with ENERGYCELL+ cushioning and a lightweight ACS chassis, it delivers exceptional shock absorption and stable support. The Contagrip outsole tackles varied terrain, while the Quicklace system offers easy wearability. It\'s a versatile choice for both outdoor adventures and city life.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 GTX in White. These waterproof trail running shoes feature GORE-TEX construction, ENERGYCELL+ cushioning, and a Contagrip outsole for all-weather protection and grip.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, White waterproof trail shoes, GORE-TEX running shoes, unisex outdoor sneakers, SensiFit, Quicklace system, Contagrip outsole, Salomon XT-6 GTX White', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX \'White\' - Waterproof Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"White\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (51, 'SALOMON XT-6 Dark Grey', '1761646330280.jpg#1761646355255.jpg#1761646362321.jpg', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Design &amp; Materials</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top silhouette . The dark grey colorway presents a minimalist and premium aesthetic . The upper combines high-strength breathable mesh &nbsp;with strategic thermal fusion reinforcement [citation: 5], ensuring lightweight durability.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Core Performance Technologies</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>SensiFit™</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole , offering a precise, glove-like fit and enclosure . The lightweight </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Agile Chassis System (ACS)</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> provides reliable stability . The </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Contagrip®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> outsole , with its unique lug pattern, delivers superior traction and slip resistance on wet or rugged terrain . </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>User-Centric Details &amp; Versatility</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The shoe features a </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Quicklace®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> quick-pull system &nbsp;for easy adjustment and secure closure ; a dedicated lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess . The molded </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>OrthoLite®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> sockliner &nbsp;enhances cushioning and breathability for long-lasting comfort . Ready for city streets or park trails , the XT-6 is an ideal companion for a dynamic lifestyle, thanks to its all-terrain capability and stylish design .</span></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-22 21:25:46.754126', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 Dark Grey blends outdoor performance with urban style. Its performance mesh upper delivers breathability and durability. With SensiFit™ technology and a lightweight ACS chassis, it ensures a snug, stable fit. The Contagrip® outsole offers reliable traction, while its low-top streamlined design suits daily commutes and light outdoor use—ideal for balancing function and style.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Dark Grey – featuring a breathable mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, ACS cushioning, and Contagrip® traction. Perfect for trail running and city life.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Dark Grey trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, breathable mesh shoes, urban outdoor footwear', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Dark Grey\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Grey\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (54, 'SALOMON XT-6 Alloy Grey', '1761646227931.jpg#1761646232607.jpg#1761646236407.jpg#1761646240177.jpg#1761646243525.jpg', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Design &amp; Materials</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top silhouette. The alloy grey colorway presents a minimalist and premium aesthetic. The upper primarily uses </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>high-performance breathable mesh</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> with reinforcement in key areas, achieving </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>lightweight breathability</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>long-lasting durability</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">. An </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>internal sleeve</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> helps secure the foot in the correct position.<br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Core Performance Technologies</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>SensiFit™</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a precise, glove-like fit. The lightweight and durable </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> provides reliable stability. The </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, delivers superior </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>slip resistance</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> and grip on wet or rugged terrain.<br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Wearing Experience &amp; Details</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\">: The shoe features the </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>Quicklace®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> quick-pull system for one-handed, instant adjustment and easy on/off. A </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>dedicated lace pocket on the tongue</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> neatly stores the excess lace, preventing snags during activity. The molded </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>OrthoLite®</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> sockliner and the </span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"><strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px;\"> work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</span></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 20:07:19.173204', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Alloy Grey skillfully blends retro style with professional outdoor performance. The upper is made of abrasion-resistant mesh for breathability and durability. Equipped with core technologies like SensiFit™, a lightweight ACS chassis, and Contagrip® outsole, it ensures a precise fit, stable support, and reliable traction across varied terrains. The iconic, streamlined silhouette in an alloy grey hue effortlessly transitions from urban commuting to light trail adventures.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Alloy Grey – featuring a breathable mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, ACS cushioning, and Contagrip® traction. Perfect for trail running and urban style.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Alloy Grey trail shoes, unisex retro sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, breathable mesh running shoes', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Alloy Grey\' - Unisex Retro Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Alloy Grey\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (55, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE Oxford Brown', '1761646161458.jpg#1761646170555.jpg#1761646173831.jpg#1761646176724.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 EXPANSE carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The rich Oxford Brown colorway lends a retro and sophisticated appeal. The upper features <strong>stitched panels and a Sensifit structure</strong>, which not only enhance the aesthetic but also work together to improve overall support and stability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, wrapping the foot like a second skin for a precise, dynamic fit. The lightweight yet robust <strong>Agile Chassis System</strong> helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability and control on challenging terrain. The <strong>Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance on both wet and uneven surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details abound, exemplified by the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system that allows for effortless tightening and quick release. A built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly secures any excess cord, preventing snags during activity. Furthermore, the combination of the <strong>EVA midsole and EnergyCell™</strong> technology provides responsive cushioning and energy return, ensuring all-day comfort underfoot.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 20:17:33.357546', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE in Oxford Brown merges outdoor functionality with urban style. Its engineered mesh upper with TPU overlays ensures lightweight durability. Featuring SensiFit™ and an Agile Chassis System for precise fit and stability, plus Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction on city streets and mountain trails.', 'Discover SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE in Oxford Brown. Features durable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for secure fit and Contagrip® traction. Ideal for trail running and urban exploration.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE, Oxford Brown trail shoes, unisex hiking sneakers, SensiFit technology, Agile Chassis System, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, durable mesh shoes', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE \'Oxford Brown\' - Unisex Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Oxford Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (56, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE LTR Black', '1761645972129.jpg#1761645984049.jpg#1761645996077.jpg#1761646001478.jpg#1761646007729.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 EXPANSE LTR carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The rich black colorway lends a retro and sophisticated appeal. The <strong>leather upper</strong> enhances the premium feel and durability. The <strong>stitched panels and Sensifit structure</strong> work together to improve overall support and stability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole for a precise, dynamic fit and enclosure. The <strong>Agile Chassis System</strong> helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability and control on challenging terrain. The <strong>Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology ensures superior slip resistance on both wet and uneven surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details abound, exemplified by the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system that allows for effortless tightening and quick release. A built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly secures any excess cord, preventing snags during activity. Furthermore, the combination of the <strong>EVA midsole</strong> and <strong>OrthoLite® sockliner</strong> provides responsive cushioning and energy return, ensuring comfort underfoot.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 20:24:33.751893', 0, 3, 50, 'The XT-6 EXPANSE LTR builds upon the classic silhouette with an upgraded premium leather upper, blending retro style with outdoor functionality while maintaining breathability and wear resistance. It incorporates the signature SensiFit™ fit system and the Agile Chassis System chassis for customized lockdown and stable support. Paired with the Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction across diverse terrains, this shoe is equipped to effortlessly transition from city streets to woodland paths.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE LTR in Black. These versatile shoes feature a premium leather upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE LTR, Black leather trail shoes, unisex hiking sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE LTR \'Black\' - Leather Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (57, 'SALOMON XT-6 Beige Brown', '1761645938294.jpg#1761645942668.jpg#1761645948348.jpg#1761645954565.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The beige-brown colorway presents a minimalist and warm aesthetic. The upper primarily uses <strong>high-performance breathable mesh</strong> with reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a precise, glove-like fit. The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong> helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability on challenging terrain. The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance on both wet and uneven surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details abound, exemplified by the <strong>Quicklace®</strong> system that allows for effortless tightening and quick release. A built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly secures any excess cord, preventing snags during activity. Furthermore, the combination of the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> and the <strong>molded OrthoLite® sockliner</strong> provides responsive cushioning and energy return, ensuring all-day comfort underfoot.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 20:31:17.968441', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Beige Brown skillfully connects outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics. The abrasion-resistant mesh upper ensures breathability and durability. It incorporates the signature SensiFit™ fit system and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) chassis for customized lockdown and stable support. Paired with the Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction across diverse terrains, this shoe is equipped to effortlessly adapt from city streets to mountain paths.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Beige Brown. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Contagrip® traction. Ideal for trails and city wear.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Beige Brown trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, breathable mesh shoes', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Beige Brown\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Beige Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (58, 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX Black Red', '1761645906924.jpg#1761645910900.jpg#1761645914879.jpg#1761645918706.jpg#1761645922647.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 GTX carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The black and red colorway delivers a powerful visual impact. The upper combines a <strong>highly durable TPU film</strong> with <strong>breathable mesh</strong>, and features <strong>anti-debris mesh</strong> and a <strong>reinforced toe cap</strong> for lightweight durability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a secure, snug, and comfortable fit. The lightweight and durable <strong>ACS (Agile Chassis System)</strong> provides reliable stability and effective shock absorption. The outsole utilizes <strong>Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern delivers superior slip resistance and grip on wet or rugged terrain.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details abound, exemplified by the <strong>Quicklace®</strong> system for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess lace. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner (in some versions) and the <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology work together to enhance shock absorption and underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 20:36:37.651293', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Black Red masterfully blends professional outdoor waterproof technology with urban style. The textile and synthetic leather upper integrates a GORE-TEX laminate for all-weather dryness and comfort. Equipped with core technologies like SensiFit™, a lightweight ACS chassis, and Contagrip® outsole, it ensures a precise fit, stable support, and reliable traction on varied terrain.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Black Red. These waterproof trail running shoes feature GORE-TEX construction, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Contagrip® traction for all-weather performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, Black Red trail shoes, waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX sneakers, unisex outdoor shoes, SensiFit, Contagrip outsole', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX \'Black Red\' - Waterproof Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black Red\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (59, 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX Black Grey Silver', '1761645874725.jpg#1761645877975.jpg#1761645882579.jpg#1761645886612.jpg#1761645890529.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 GORE-TEX carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The black, grey, and silver color combination presents a <strong>retro</strong> and layered aesthetic. The upper uses <strong>synthetic materials, textiles, and an anti-debris mesh structure</strong>, complemented by a <strong>reinforced toe cap</strong> for lightweight durability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a secure, snug, and comfortable fit. The <strong>Agile Chassis System™ (ACS)</strong> combined with a specific outsole lug geometry provides reliable stability and effective shock absorption. The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern delivers superior slip resistance and grip on wet or rugged terrain.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details abound, exemplified by the <strong>Quicklace®</strong> system for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess lace. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, cushioned EVA midsole</strong> work together to enhance shock absorption and underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 20:43:52.711942', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX in Black Grey Silver masterfully blends professional outdoor waterproof technology with urban style. The upper integrates a PFC-free GORE-TEX ePE membrane for reliable wet weather protection. It incorporates the SensiFit™ fit system, Agile Chassis System (ACS) chassis, and Mud Contagrip® outsole for precise lockdown, stable support, and all-terrain traction.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX in Black Grey Silver. These waterproof shoes feature a GORE-TEX membrane, SensiFit™, and Contagrip® traction for all-weather performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX, Black Grey Silver trail shoes, waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX sneakers, unisex outdoor shoes, SensiFit, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole', 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX \'Black Grey Silver\' - Waterproof Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black Grey Silver\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (60, 'SALOMON XT-6 Navy Blue & Lemon Yellow', '1761645822036.jpg#1761645827414.jpg#1761645832945.jpg#1761645837823.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 collaborative model carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The navy blue base contrasted with lemon yellow details creates a stylish and eye-catching aesthetic. The upper primarily uses <strong>high-performance breathable mesh</strong> with reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a precise, glove-like fit. The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong> helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability and control on challenging terrain. The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance on both wet and uneven surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details abound, exemplified by the <strong>Quicklace®</strong> system that allows for effortless tightening and quick release. A built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly secures any excess cord, preventing snags during activity. Furthermore, the combination of the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> and the <strong>molded OrthoLite® sockliner</strong> provides responsive cushioning and energy return, ensuring all-day comfort underfoot.<br></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 21:38:25.995098', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 collaborative edition showcases a striking navy blue and lemon yellow colorway. Its high-performance mesh upper delivers breathability and durability. Featuring SensiFit™ for precise fit and ACS chassis for stable support. The Contagrip® outsole with unique lug pattern ensures superior traction on varied terrain, ideal for urban and outdoor use.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Navy Blue & Lemon Yellow. These collaborative shoes feature a breathable mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Navy Blue Lemon Yellow, collaborative sneakers, unisex trail shoes, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Navy Blue & Lemon Yellow\' - Collaborative Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Navy Blue & Lemon Yellow\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (61, 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX Grey Brown', '1761645785612.jpg#1761645791876.jpg#1761645798002.jpg#1761645801940.jpg#1761645807670.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 GORE-TEX carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The grey-brown colorway presents a <strong>retro and versatile</strong> aesthetic that adapts to various settings. The upper utilizes <strong>synthetic materials and textiles</strong>, featuring a <strong>reinforced toe cap</strong> for lightweight durability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a secure, snug, and comfortable fit. The lightweight and durable <strong>ACS (Agile Chassis System)</strong>, combined with specific outsole lug geometry, provides reliable stability and effective shock absorption. The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern delivers superior slip resistance and grip on wet or rugged terrain.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details are evident in the <strong>Quicklace®</strong> system for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess lace. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, cushioned EVA midsole</strong> work together to enhance shock absorption and underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 21:44:45.596083', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX in Grey Brown perfectly blends waterproof technology with all-weather performance. The upper features GORE-TEX ePE membrane for reliable protection and anti-debris mesh for durability. With SensiFit™ for customized fit and ACS chassis for stable support. Mud Contagrip® outsole ensures reliable traction on varied terrain, handling both wet trails and urban commutes with ease.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX in Grey Brown. These waterproof shoes feature a GORE-TEX membrane, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Contagrip® traction for all-weather performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX, Grey Brown trail shoes, waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX sneakers, unisex outdoor shoes, SensiFit, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole', 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX \'Grey Brown\' - Waterproof Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Grey Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (62, 'SALOMON XT-6 White', '1761650247727.jpg#1761650250489.jpg#1761650252758.jpg#1761650255362.jpg', '<p><br></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-27 22:01:29.581549', 0, 3, 50, 'The white SALOMON XT-6 perfectly blends professional outdoor performance with urban style. The abrasion-resistant mesh upper ensures breathability and durability. Featuring SensiFit™ for precise fit and Agile Chassis System for stable support. Contagrip® outsole delivers reliable traction on varied terrain, easily handling city streets and outdoor paths.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in White. Features a breathable mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance. Ideal for trails and city life.', 'SALOMON XT-6, White trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'White\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"White\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (63, 'SALOMON XT-6 Grey', '1761650004596.jpg#1761650007620.jpg#1761650009940.jpg#1761650012628.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The grey colorway presents a minimalist and premium aesthetic. The upper primarily uses <strong>high-performance breathable mesh</strong> with reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a precise, glove-like fit. The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong> helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability on challenging terrain. The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance on both wet and uneven surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details abound, exemplified by the <strong>Quicklace®</strong> system that allows for effortless tightening and quick release. A built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly secures any excess cord, preventing snags during activity. Furthermore, the combination of the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> and the <strong>molded OrthoLite® sockliner</strong> provides responsive cushioning and energy return, ensuring all-day comfort underfoot.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 19:14:16.809093', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Grey skillfully connects professional outdoor performance with minimalist urban aesthetics. The abrasion-resistant mesh upper ensures breathability and durability. It incorporates the signature SensiFit™ fit system and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) chassis for customized lockdown and stable support. Paired with the Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction across diverse terrains, this shoe is equipped to effortlessly adapt from city streets to mountain paths.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Grey. Features a breathable mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Grey trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, breathable mesh shoes', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Grey\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Grey\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (64, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE CANVAS Beige Green', '1761650647061.jpg#1761650649609.jpg#1761650651958.jpg#1761650654241.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 EXPANSE CANVAS carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The beige-green hue paired with the canvas upper creates a clean and fresh appeal. The upper features stitched panels and a Sensifit structure, which enhance overall support and visual layering. A plaid pattern on the sockliner adds a detailed touch.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology is integrated with the upper through stitching and works in conjunction with the internal Endofit system to achieve a secure and precise foot fixation. The Agile Chassis System™, combined with specific outsole lug geometry, provides reliable stability and helps guide the foot on challenging terrain. The outsole utilizes Contagrip® rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern ensures superior grip on various surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The shoe uses a classic lacing system. The combination of the EVA midsole and the Molded OrthoLite® sockliner offers responsive cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort. Its low-top, streamlined silhouette and unique beige-green colorway offer great styling potential, seamlessly transitioning from outdoor to urban casual looks.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 19:25:23.166448', 0, 3, 50, 'This XT-6 EXPANSE CANVAS in Beige Green is part of Salomon\'s CANVAS PACK. The cotton canvas upper offers a fresh take on the classic silhouette, delivering a lightweight and breathable wearing experience. It incorporates the SensiFit™ fit system and the Agile Chassis System chassis for precise lockdown and stable support. Paired with Contagrip® outsole technology, it reliably tackles varied terrains, making it ideal for long-distance running and everyday wear.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE CANVAS in Beige Green. Features a lightweight canvas upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Contagrip® traction for all-terrain running.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE CANVAS, Beige Green trail shoes, canvas sneakers, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Contagrip outsole', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE CANVAS \'Beige Green\' - Unisex Canvas Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Beige Green\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (65, 'SALOMON XT-6 White', '1761651133214.jpg#1761651135948.jpg#1761651138656.jpg#1761651141149.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The pure white colorway presents a clean and minimalist look. The upper uses a single-layer mesh combined with a highly durable TPU film for reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability. An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, working with the EndoFit™ internal structure for a precise, glove-like fit. The lightweight yet robust Agile Chassis System™ helps guide your feet through rough terrain, offering reassuring stability and control. The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance and grip on wet or uneven terrain.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace™ system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess lace. The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the EVA midsole work together to provide responsive cushioning and energy return, ensuring all-day comfort underfoot.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 19:33:21.063598', 0, 3, 50, 'The white SALOMON XT-6, designed for elite ultra-distance athletes, perfectly blends professional outdoor performance with urban aesthetics. The single-layer mesh upper with durable TPU film ensures lightweight breathability and lasting durability. Featuring SensiFit™ for precise fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stable support. Mud Contagrip® outsole delivers superior traction on varied terrain, easily handling city commutes and mountain trails.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in White. Features a breathable mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, White trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'White\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"White\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (66, 'SALOMON XT-6 Vanilla, Green Mist & Brick Red', '1761651481541.jpg#1761651483823.jpg#1761651486013.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The unique combination of Vanilla, Green Mist, and Brick Red presents a vibrant yet grounded aesthetic. The upper primarily uses <strong>high-performance breathable mesh</strong> with reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit. The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong> chassis helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability on challenging terrain. The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology employs a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to enhance slip resistance.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Thoughtful details abound, exemplified by the <strong>Quicklace®</strong> system for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess lace. Furthermore, the combination of the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> and the <strong>molded OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner provides excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 19:38:49.649054', 0, 3, 50, 'This SALOMON XT-6 features a unique color-blocking of Vanilla, Green Mist and Brick Red. The abrasion-resistant mesh upper ensures lightweight breathability and durability. With SensiFit™ for precise fit and Agile Chassis System for stable support. Mud Contagrip® outsole delivers reliable traction on varied terrain, adapting to both urban and trail environments.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Vanilla, Green Mist & Brick Red. Features a breathable mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Vanilla Green Mist Brick Red, unisex trail shoes, SensiFit, ACS chassis, Mud Contagrip, Quicklace, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Vanilla Green Mist Brick Red\' - Unisex Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Vanilla Green Mist Brick Red\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (67, 'SALOMON XT-6 Pink Brown', '1761651863404.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The pink-brown colorway presents a soft and stylish aesthetic. The upper primarily uses high-performance breathable mesh with reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability. An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a precise, glove-like fit. The lightweight yet robust Agile Chassis System helps guide your feet through rough terrain, offering reassuring stability and control. The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern and high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs, enhances slip resistance.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace® system allows for effortless tightening and quick release; a built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly secures any excess cord, preventing snags during activity. Furthermore, the combination of the molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole provides excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 19:45:22.107368', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Pink Brown blends outdoor performance with urban aesthetics. The abrasion-resistant mesh upper ensures breathability and durability. Featuring SensiFit™ for precise fit and Agile Chassis System for stable support. Mud Contagrip® outsole delivers reliable traction on varied terrain, suitable for urban and outdoor use.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Pink Brown. Features a breathable mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance. Ideal for trails and city life.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Pink Brown trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Contagrip outsole, Quicklace system, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Pink Brown\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Pink Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (68, 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX Dark Blue', '1761652307786.jpg#1761652310287.jpg#1761652312628.jpg#1761652315543.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Waterproof Technology &amp; Design: The XT-6 GORE-TEX carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The deep blue colorway lends a sophisticated appeal. The upper combines a highly durable TPU film with breathable mesh, and features anti-debris mesh and a reinforced toe cap for lightweight durability. Its GORE-TEX ePE membrane effectively blocks rain while maintaining good breathability for lasting comfort.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Features: The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a secure, snug, and comfortable fit. The lightweight and durable ACS (Agile Chassis System), combined with a specific downhill chassis and lug geometry, provides reliable stability and effective shock absorption. The outsole utilizes Mud Contagrip® rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern delivers superior slip resistance and grip on wet or rugged terrain.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The shoe features the Quicklace® quick-pull system for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess lace. The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the soft, cushioned EVA midsole work together to enhance shock absorption, breathability, and underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 19:53:15.436324', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX in Dark Blue blends waterproof technology with urban style. The GORE-TEX ePE membrane provides reliable protection. Featuring SensiFit™ for precise fit and ACS chassis for stable support. Mud Contagrip® outsole ensures all-terrain traction for wet trails and city commutes.', 'Discover SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX in Dark Blue. Features waterproof GORE-TEX construction, SensiFit™ for secure fit, and Contagrip® traction. Ideal for all-weather performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX, Dark Blue trail shoes, waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX, men\'s outdoor shoes, SensiFit, Contagrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 GORE-TEX \'Dark Blue\' - Waterproof Trail Running Shoes (Men\'s)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Dark Blue\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (69, 'SALOMON XT-6 Black', '1761652678462.jpg#1761652680973.jpg#1761652683420.jpg#1761652685732.jpg#1761652688009.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The pure black colorway presents a versatile and minimalist look. The upper uses a single-layer mesh combined with a highly durable TPU film for reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability. An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, working with the EndoFit™ internal structure for a precise, glove-like fit. The lightweight yet robust Agile Chassis System™ helps guide your feet through rough terrain, offering reassuring stability and control. The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance and grip on wet or uneven terrain.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace™ system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess lace. The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the EVA midsole work together to provide responsive cushioning and energy return, ensuring all-day comfort underfoot.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 19:58:50.896663', 0, 3, 50, 'The black SALOMON XT-6 blends professional outdoor performance with urban aesthetics. The single-layer mesh and durable TPU upper ensure breathability and durability. Featuring SensiFit™ for precise fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stable support. Mud Contagrip® outsole delivers all-terrain traction for city and outdoor use.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Black. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance. Ideal for trails and city life.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Black trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, Quicklace, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Black\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (70, 'SALOMON XT-6 CAMO Silver Grey', '1761653122938.jpg#1761653125434.jpg#1761653129143.jpg#1761653160192.jpg#1761653162434.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 CAMO carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The silver-grey colorway combined with the camouflage pattern creates a unique urban-utility style. The upper uses high-performance breathable mesh with reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability. An internal fit sleeve (endoFit™) is designed to hug the foot for a precise fit.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure, snug, and virtually customized fit. The lightweight yet robust ACS (Agile Chassis System) helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability on challenging terrain. The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology uses deep, sharp lugs made from a high-adhesion compound for maximum grip on loose, soft, and uneven surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace® quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure; a built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess cord. The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole work together to provide superior cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 20:07:28.087412', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 CAMO in Silver Grey blends outdoor performance with urban style. The camo design and durable mesh upper ensure breathability. Featuring SensiFit™ for precise fit and ACS chassis for stable support. Mud Contagrip® outsole delivers all-terrain traction for city and outdoor use.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 CAMO in Silver Grey. Features a camo mesh upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance. Ideal for trails and city life.', 'SALOMON XT-6 CAMO, Silver Grey trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Mud Contagrip outsole, camo design, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 CAMO \'Silver Grey\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Silver Grey\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (71, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE COZY Oxford Brown', '1761653569529.jpg#1761653573008.jpg#1761653575383.jpg#1761653577773.jpg#1761653580102.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 EXPANSE COZY carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The rich Oxford Brown colorway, paired with a comfort-updated lining, offers a retro and versatile appeal. The textile and synthetic upper ensures lightweight durability.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, offering a secure, snug, and comfortable fit. The Agile Chassis System™ provides reliable foot stability. The outsole utilizes Mud Contagrip® rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern delivers superior slip resistance and grip on challenging terrain.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The shoe features the Quicklace™ quick-pull system for easy adjustment and secure closure. The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the soft, cushioned EVA midsole work together to enhance shock absorption and underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 20:13:39.197817', 0, 3, 50, 'The XT-6 EXPANSE COZY in Oxford Brown blends professional outdoor technology with urban casual style. The textile and synthetic upper features retro textures and stitch detailing for a premium, durable feel. It incorporates the SensiFit™ system and Agile Chassis System™ chassis for precise lockdown and stable support. The Mud Contagrip® outsole ensures reliable all-terrain traction.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE COZY in Oxford Brown. Features a textile and synthetic upper with SensiFit™ and Agile Chassis System™ for stable support. Ideal for urban and light trail use.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE COZY, Oxford Brown trail shoes, unisex sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, comfortable lining', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE COZY \'Oxford Brown\' - Unisex Trail Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Oxford Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (72, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL Grey', '1761653876493.jpg#1761653878658.jpg#1761653881358.jpg#1761653883572.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile . The grey colorway presents a minimalist and versatile aesthetic. The upper uses lightweight and breathable mesh with reinforcement in key areas, achieving breathability and long-lasting durability . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure and snug fit . The lightweight yet robust Agile Chassis System™ helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability . The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology uses a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to enhance slip resistance .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace® quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure ; a built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess cord . The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 20:19:15.117332', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Grey blends outdoor performance with urban style. The engineered mesh and TPU upper ensures breathability and durability. Featuring SensiFit™ for precise fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stable support. Mud Contagrip® outsole delivers all-terrain traction for city and outdoor use.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Grey. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL, Grey trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit technology, ACS chassis, Mud Contagrip outsole, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL \'Grey\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Grey\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (73, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE White Black', '1761654239841.jpg#1761654242219.jpg#1761654244653.jpg#1761654246852.jpg#1761654249400.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 EXPANSE carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile . The White and Black colorway presents a minimalist and versatile aesthetic. The upper features stitched panels and a Sensifit structure, which enhance overall support and visual layering . The upper primarily uses high-performance breathable mesh with reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology is integrated with the upper through stitching and works in conjunction with the internal Endofit system to achieve a secure and precise foot fixation, offering a precise, glove-like fit . The lightweight and durable ACS (Advanced Chassis System) provides reliable stability and helps guide the foot on challenging terrain . The outsole utilizes Mud Contagrip® rubber technology, which employs a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to enhance slip resistance and ensure superior grip on wet or rugged terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The shoe features the Quicklace® quick-pull system for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess lace, preventing snags during activity . The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Its low-top, streamlined silhouette offers great styling potential, seamlessly transitioning from outdoor to urban casual looks .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 20:25:01.812657', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE in White Black blends outdoor performance with urban style. Its engineered mesh and TPU upper ensures lightweight durability. With SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability. Mud Contagrip® outsole provides reliable traction on varied terrain. Ideal for city streets and woodland paths.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE in White Black. Features a durable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE, White Black trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, ACS chassis, Mud Contagrip outsole, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE \'White Black\' - Unisex Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"White Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (74, 'SALOMON XT-6 Lilac Purple', '1761654548894.jpg#1761654551093.jpg#1761654553104.jpg#1761654555550.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top profile . The soft Lilac Purple colorway presents a gentle and stylish aesthetic. The upper primarily uses high-performance breathable mesh with reinforcement in key areas, achieving lightweight breathability and long-lasting durability . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure and comfortable, custom-like fit . The lightweight yet robust Agile Chassis System™ helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability . The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology uses a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to enhance slip resistance .</p><ul><li style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace® quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure ; a built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess cord, preventing snags during activity . The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort .</li></ul>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 20:30:35.765016', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Lilac Purple blends outdoor performance with soft aesthetics. Its durable mesh upper ensures lightweight comfort and breathability. Features SensiFit™ for secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability. Mud Contagrip® outsole provides reliable traction. Ideal for city streets and park trails.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Lilac Purple for women. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Lilac Purple womens shoes, trail running sneakers, SensiFit, ACS chassis, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Lilac Purple\' - Women\'s Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\" Color\",\"value\":\"Lilac Purple\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (75, 'SALOMON XT-6 CHROMATIC Black, Mist Blue, Grey Blue', '1761654975098.jpg#1761654977207.jpg#1761654979639.jpg#1761654981816.jpg#1761654983934.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 CHROMATIC carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile . The color combination of Black, Mist Blue, and Grey Blue presents a unique and layered aesthetic. The upper primarily uses abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh for a lightweight and durable build . The tongue features a lace storage space to effectively prevent the laces from coming loose during activity .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit . The lightweight yet robust ACS (Advanced Chassis System) chassis offers reliable stability and support . The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology employs a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to significantly enhance slip resistance on challenging terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace® quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure with one hand . The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 20:37:22.425460', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 CHROMATIC blends outdoor performance with retro style. Its durable mesh upper ensures lightweight comfort. Features SensiFit™ for secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability. Mud Contagrip® outsole provides reliable traction. Ideal for urban and trail use.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 CHROMATIC. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 CHROMATIC, Black Mist Blue trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, ACS chassis, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 CHROMATIC \'Black Mist Blue Grey Blue\' - Unisex Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black Mist Blue Grey Blue\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (76, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE Grey Purple', '1761655609880.jpg#1761655612238.jpg#1761655614464.jpg#1761655617426.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 EXPANSE carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile . The Grey Purple colorway presents a unique and layered aesthetic . The upper features stitched panels and a Sensifit structure , with TPU film welded onto the abrasion-resistant mesh in key areas for durability , achieving a balance of premium feel and practicality .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit . The lightweight yet robust ACS (Advanced Chassis System) chassis offers reliable stability and support . The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology employs a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to significantly enhance slip resistance on challenging terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace® quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure ; the tongue features a lace storage space to neatly store the excess cord. The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the dual-density EVA midsole work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-28 20:47:46.586980', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE in Grey Purple skillfully blends professional outdoor performance with urban aesthetics . The leather and textile upper offers a premium feel and durability . It incorporates the signature SensiFit™ fit system and the Agile Chassis System chassis for customized lockdown and stable support . Paired with the Contragrip™ rubber outsole for reliable traction across diverse terrains , this shoe is equipped to effortlessly adapt from city streets to mountain paths .', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE in Grey Purple. Features a leather and textile upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Contragrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE, Grey Purple trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, ACS chassis, Contragrip outsole, durable leather textile upper', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE \'Grey Purple\' - Unisex Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Grey Purple\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (77, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL Lilac Purple Grey', '1761735982166.jpg#1761735985082.jpg#1761735986660.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile . The soft Lilac Purple Grey colorway presents a unique and stylish aesthetic. The upper uses lightweight and breathable mesh with stitched panels and a Sensifit structure for reinforcement in key areas, achieving breathability and long-lasting durability while enhancing overall support .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit . The lightweight yet robust Agile Chassis System™ helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability on challenging terrain . The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology uses a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to enhance slip resistance .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The shoe uses a classic lacing system . The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the dual-density EVA midsole work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort. Its low-top, streamlined silhouette and unique Lilac Purple Grey colorway offer great styling potential for various scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-29 19:14:21.733884', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Lilac Purple Grey blends outdoor performance with urban style. Its engineered mesh upper ensures lightweight durability. Features SensiFit™ for secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability. Mud Contagrip® outsole provides reliable traction. Ideal for urban and trail use.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Lilac Purple Grey. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL, Lilac Purple Grey trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL \'Lilac Purple Grey\' - Unisex Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Lilac Purple Grey\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (78, 'SALOMON XT-6 Beige Grey', '1761736505858.jpg#1761736508295.jpg#1761736510350.jpg#1761736512458.jpg#1761736514601.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The Beige Grey colorway presents a minimalist and versatile aesthetic. The upper primarily uses high-performance breathable mesh combined with a highly durable TPU film for reinforcement in key areas. An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in place.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit. The lightweight yet robust Agile Chassis System™ helps guide the foot, offering reassuring stability on challenging terrain. The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance and grip on wet or uneven surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace® quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure. A built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess cord. The molded sockliner and the ENERGYCELL+ cushioned midsole work together to provide excellent shock absorption and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-29 19:16:19.195331', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Beige Grey blends professional outdoor performance with urban style. Its durable mesh upper ensures lightweight comfort and breathability. Featuring the SensiFit™ system for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain. The Mud Contagrip® outsole provides reliable traction. Ideal for trail running, city commuting, and diverse urban activities.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Beige Grey. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Beige Grey trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Beige Grey\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Beige Grey\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (79, 'SALOMON XT-6 Off White', '1761736919639.jpg#1761736921889.jpg#1761736923814.jpg#1761736926449.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">Design &amp; Materials: The XT-6 features the iconic streamlined, low-top profile. The Off White colorway presents a minimalist and versatile aesthetic. The upper uses a single-layer mesh combined with a highly durable TPU film for reinforcement in key areas. An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Core Performance Technologies: The SensiFit™ technology extends from the lacing system to the midsole, working with the EndoFit™ internal structure to wrap the entire foot for a superior, precise fit. The lightweight yet robust Agile Chassis System™ helps guide your feet through rough terrain, offering reassuring stability. The Mud Contagrip® outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance and grip on wet or uneven surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Wearing Experience &amp; Details: The Quicklace™ system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure; a built-in lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess cord. The molded OrthoLite® sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-29 19:22:56.099485', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Off White blends professional outdoor performance with versatile urban style. Its single-layer mesh and abrasion-resistant TPU upper ensure lightweight comfort and lasting durability. Inheriting a design made for elite athletes, it incorporates the signature SensiFit™ system and Agile Chassis System™ for a precise, glove-like fit and stable support. The Mud Contagrip® outsole provides reliable traction across diverse terrains.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Off White. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Off White trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Off White\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Off White\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (80, 'SALOMON XT-6 Tan Brown', '1761738983300.jpg#1761738985683.jpg#1761738988381.jpg#1761738991072.jpg#1761738993687.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Tan Brown XT-6 carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics. The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh</strong> with <strong>TPU overlays</strong> for a lightweight and durable build .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> system integrates with the lacing structure and extends to the midsole, delivering a precise, custom-like fit . The <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis helps guide foot movement, offering stable support on challenging terrain . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole employs a high-traction rubber compound with deep, sharp lugs for enhanced slip resistance .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system allows for one-handed adjustment, while a built-in lace pocket keeps the cord tidy . The <strong>Molded OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to ensure lasting cushioning and underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts to diverse scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-29 19:57:45.855839', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Tan Brown combines professional outdoor performance with versatile urban style . Its durable mesh upper with TPU reinforcements ensures lightweight comfort and long-lasting wear . The shoe incorporates SensiFit™ technology for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain . With the Mud Contagrip® outsole providing reliable traction , it is equipped for both trail running and city commuting.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Tan Brown. Features a durable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction. Ideal for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Tan Brown trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Tan Brown\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Tan Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (82, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL Green', '1761740411807.jpg#1761740414489.jpg#1761740417062.jpg#1761740419747.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Green XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh</strong> with <strong>TPU overlays</strong> for a lightweight and durable build . An internal sleeve secures the foot in place .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> system extends from the midsole to the lacing structure, delivering a precise, custom-like fit . The <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis helps guide foot movement, offering reliable stability on challenging terrain . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole employs a high-traction rubber compound with deep, sharp lugs for enhanced slip resistance .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system enables one-handed adjustment, while a built-in lace pocket keeps the cord tidy . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to ensure lasting cushioning and underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-29 20:21:31.151239', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Green combines professional outdoor heritage with urban versatility . Its durable mesh upper with TPU reinforcements ensures lightweight comfort and long-lasting performance . The shoe integrates SensiFit™ for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain . Equipped with Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction, it is designed to transition seamlessly from trail paths to city streets .', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Green. Features a durable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL, Green trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL \'Green\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Green\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (83, 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX Grey, Feather Grey&Pale Pink', '1761743069950.jpg#1761743072335.jpg#1761743074670.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 GTX in Grey, Feather Grey, and Pale Pink carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>lightweight breathable mesh</strong> with <strong>TPU overlays</strong> and <strong>anti-debris mesh construction</strong>, integrated with a <strong>PFC-free GORE-TEX ePE membrane</strong> for lightweight durability and all-weather protection . An internal sleeve secures the foot in place, offering a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> system extends from the midsole to the lacing structure, delivering a superior, precise fit that cradles the entire foot . The <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis helps guide foot movement, and, combined with specific outsole lug geometry, provides reliable stability and shock absorption on challenging terrain . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole employs a high-traction rubber compound with deep, sharp lugs for enhanced slip resistance and grip on wet or rugged surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system enables one-handed adjustment, while a built-in lace pocket keeps the cord tidy . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> (some versions feature <strong>ENERGYCELL+</strong> cushioning) work together to ensure lasting cushioning and underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios.<br></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-29 21:05:34.489321', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Grey, Feather Grey, and Pale Pink combines professional outdoor performance with versatile urban style . Its engineered mesh upper with TPU reinforcements and GORE-TEX membrane ensures lightweight comfort, durability, and all-weather protection . The shoe integrates SensiFit™ for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain .', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Grey, Feather Grey & Pale Pink. Features a GORE-TEX waterproof membrane, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, Grey Feather Grey Pale Pink trail shoes, waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX sneakers, unisex outdoor shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX \'Grey Feather Grey Pale Pink\' - Unisex Waterproof Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Grey Feather Grey Pale Pink\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (84, 'SALOMON XT-6 Dark Grey, Black, Silver & Cyan', '1761822679197.jpg#1761822681578.jpg#1761822683810.jpg#1761822686114.jpg#1761822688553.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 carries the line\'s iconic streamlined, low-top profile . The color combination of Dark Grey, Black, Silver, and Cyan presents a grounded yet vibrant aesthetic. The upper primarily uses <strong>abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh</strong> , combining a highly durable TPU film with mesh &nbsp;for a lightweight, breathable, and durable build .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">At its core, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit . The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong> chassis &nbsp;offers reliable stability and support. The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology employs a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to enhance slip resistance .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For daily use, the <strong>Quicklace®</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure ; the tongue features a lace storage space to neatly store the excess cord, preventing snags during activity . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 19:12:08.463316', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 skillfully blends professional outdoor performance with urban style . The abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh upper  ensures a lightweight and durable wearing experience. Originally designed for trail runners , it has now become a coveted item in the outdoor-style trend . It incorporates the signature SensiFit™ fit system and the Agile Chassis System chassis  for customized lockdown and stable support .', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Dark Grey Black Silver Cyan trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Dark Grey Black Silver Cyan\' - Unisex Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Dark Grey Black Silver Cyan\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (85, 'SALOMON XT-6 Black', '1761823030027.jpg#1761823032566.jpg#1761823035286.jpg#1761823037489.jpg#1761823039917.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Black XT-6 carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh</strong> with <strong>TPU film</strong> for enhanced durability, achieving a lightweight and breathable build . An internal sleeve secures the foot in place, offering a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> system extends from the midsole to the lacing structure, delivering a superior, precise, and custom-like fit . The <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis helps guide foot movement, offering reliable stability on challenging terrain . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole employs a high-traction rubber compound combined with deep, sharp lugs for enhanced slip resistance and grip on wet or rugged surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system enables one-handed adjustment for easy wearability; a dedicated lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess cord . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to ensure excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 19:17:53.784741', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Black blends professional outdoor performance with versatile urban style . Its durable mesh upper with TPU reinforcements ensures lightweight comfort and long-lasting wear . The shoe integrates SensiFit™ for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain . Equipped with Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction and a Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly from trail paths to city streets.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Black. Features a durable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Black trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Black\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (86, 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX Urban Grey Black & Lime Cream', '1761823409760.jpg#1761823412252.jpg#1761823415133.jpg#1761823417754.jpg#1761823420009.jpg', '<p><br></p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 19:24:19.557520', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Urban Grey Black & Lime Cream blends rugged trail performance with urban style . Its build incorporates a GORE-TEX membrane for all-weather protection . The shoe features the SensiFit™ system for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support . Equipped with a Contragrip™ outsole for reliable traction and a Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly from mountain paths to city streets.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Urban Grey Black & Lime Cream. These waterproof shoes feature GORE-TEX construction, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Contragrip™ traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, Urban Grey Black Lime Cream, waterproof trail shoes, unisex sneakers, GORE-TEX, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Contragrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX \'Urban Grey Black & Lime Cream\' - Unisex Waterproof Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Urban Grey Black & Lime Cream\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (87, 'SALOMON XT-6 Khaki Black', '1761825906510.jpg#1761825908707.jpg#1761825911035.jpg#1761825913852.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Khaki Black XT-6 carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The <strong>premium leather upper</strong> provides a sophisticated feel and excellent durability. An internal sleeve secures the foot in place, offering a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, delivering a precise, glove-like fit . The <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis helps guide foot movement, offering reliable stability on challenging terrain . The <strong>Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, ensures superior slip resistance and grip on wet or rugged surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system allows for one-handed adjustment and secure closure ; a dedicated lace pocket on the tongue neatly stores the excess cord . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 20:05:56.023473', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Khaki Black combines professional outdoor heritage with premium urban style . Its premium leather upper offers a sophisticated look and durable wear . The shoe integrates SensiFit™ for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain . Equipped with Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction and a Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly from trail paths to city streets .', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Khaki Black. Features a premium leather upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Khaki Black trail shoes, unisex leather sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Contagrip, premium leather', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Khaki Black\' - Unisex Leather Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Khaki Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (88, 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX Blue White', '1761826168189.jpg#1761826170538.jpg#1761826173202.jpg#1761826175532.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Blue White XT-6 GTX carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>synthetic and textile materials</strong> and integrates a <strong>GORE-TEX® ePE membrane</strong> for a lightweight, breathable, and fully waterproof build . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . The lightweight and durable <strong>ACS (Agile Chassis System)</strong> chassis provides reliable stability and support . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, delivers reliable traction and slip resistance on wet or rugged terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue stores the excess lace . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide excellent cushioning and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 20:10:10.940646', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Blue White blends rugged trail heritage with urban style . It features a PFC-free GORE-TEX ePE membrane for waterproof protection and an anti-debris mesh upper for durability . The shoe integrates SensiFit™ for a secure fit and the Agile Chassis System for stable support on varied terrain . Equipped with Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction and a Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly from mountain paths to city streets .', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Blue White. These waterproof shoes feature a GORE-TEX membrane, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, Blue White trail shoes, mens waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX \'Blue White\' - Men\'s Waterproof Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Blue White\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (89, 'END. x SALOMON XT-6 “20th Anniversary” Grey Black Green', '1761826404617.jpg#1761826406766.jpg#1761826408893.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This collaborative XT-6 is a special edition crafted to commemorate the 20th anniversary of END. . The upper utilizes <strong>deep grey breathable mesh</strong>, complemented by <strong>sleek silver and black abrasion-resistant TPU overlays</strong> that wrap around the shoe for a layered and technical look . A striking <strong>emerald green</strong> accents the tongue label, eyelet stitching, and the marble-patterned outsole, creating a vibrant visual highlight . The brand tag on the tongue features both Salomon and END. logos, along with the \"20th Anniversary\" inscription, emphasizing its unique collaborative identity and commemorative significance .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, it inherits the excellent genes of the XT-6 series. The <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the upper, providing a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit . The lightweight and durable <strong>ACS (Agile Chassis System)</strong> chassis ensures stability during movement . The outsole employs <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> technology, which combines a high-traction compound with deep, sharp lugs to significantly enhance slip resistance on challenging terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner, together with the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong>, provides excellent cushioning and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from urban commuting to trail training, this collaborative shoe balances trendy aesthetics with practical functionality.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 20:15:53.196635', 0, 3, 50, 'The END. x SALOMON XT-6 \"20th Anniversary\" celebrates END.\'s 20th milestone with a design that blends rugged trail capability and urban style . It features a deep grey mesh upper accented with sleek silver, black TPU overlays, and striking emerald green details on the tongue, eyelets, and marble-inspired outsole . This collaborative shoe incorporates Salomon\'s performance technologies including the SensiFit™ system for a precise fit and Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction , making it eq', 'Discover the limited END. x SALOMON XT-6 \"20th Anniversary\" sneakers in Grey Black Green. This collaborative pair features a unique design with premium materials, SensiFit™ for a precise fit, and Mud', 'END. Salomon XT-6, 20th Anniversary, collaborative sneakers, Grey Black Green trail shoes, limited edition, SensiFit, Mud Contagrip, unisex running shoes', 'END. x SALOMON XT-6 \"20th Anniversary\" Grey Black Green - Unisex Collaborative Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Grey Black Green\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (90, 'SALOMON XT-6 Cavalry Clear Light Blue', '1761827497190.jpg#1761827499534.jpg#1761827501926.jpg#1761827504337.jpg#1761827506575.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 in Cavalry Clear Light Blue carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban fashion aesthetics . The upper primarily uses <strong>abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh</strong> for a lightweight and durable build . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit . The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong> chassis helps guide the foot, offering reliable stability and support . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology employs a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to enhance slip resistance and ensure superior grip on wet or rugged terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure; the tongue features a lace storage space to neatly store the excess cord . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 20:32:35.434145', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Cavalry Clear Light Blue merges trail heritage with urban style. Its breathable mesh upper ensures lightweight comfort. Features SensiFit™ for secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability. Mud Contagrip® outsole provides reliable traction. Quicklace™ system enables easy adjustment. Ideal for city and trail use.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Cavalry Clear Light Blue. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Cavalry Clear Light Blue trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Cavalry Clear Light Blue\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Cavalry Clear Light Blue\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (91, 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL Moss Green', '1761828176860.jpg#1761828179129.jpg#1761828183967.jpg#1761828186513.jpg#1761828189022.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Moss Green carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh</strong>, complemented by <strong>stitched panels and a Sensifit structure</strong> for enhanced support and visual layering , achieving a lightweight and durable build . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology cradles the foot from the midsole to the lacing system, providing a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit . The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong> chassis helps guide the foot, offering reliable stability and support . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology employs a high-traction compound combined with deep, sharp lugs to enhance slip resistance and ensure superior grip on wet or rugged terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for one-handed, instant adjustment and secure closure ; the tongue features a lace storage space to neatly store the excess cord . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide excellent cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 20:43:42.794725', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Moss Green blends rugged trail heritage with versatile urban style . Its durable and breathable mesh upper ensures a lightweight and comfortable wearing experience . The shoe integrates the SensiFit™ system for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain . Equipped with the Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction and a Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL in Moss Green. Features a breathable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL, Moss Green trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip, breathable mesh', 'SALOMON XT-6 EXPANSE SEASONAL \'Moss Green\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Moss Green\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (92, 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX  Antelope Brown, Pale Ice Green & Mushroom Brown', '1761828966398.jpg#1761828973276.jpg#1761828975769.jpg#1761828978021.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The XT-6 GTX carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette. The color combination of Antelope Brown, Pale Ice Green, and Mushroom Brown presents a unique outdoor aesthetic . The upper uses <strong>textile and synthetic materials</strong> and integrates a <strong>GORE-TEX® membrane</strong> for fully waterproof protection and breathability . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . The lightweight and durable <strong>ACS (Agile Chassis System)</strong> chassis, combined with specific outsole lug geometry, provides reliable stability and shock absorption . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, delivers reliable traction and slip resistance on wet or rugged terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue stores the excess lace . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide excellent cushioning and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 20:56:07.116496', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Antelope Brown, Pale Ice Green, and Mushroom Brown blends rugged trail performance with versatile urban style . It features a GORE-TEX membrane for all-weather protection . The shoe integrates the SensiFit™ system for a secure, precise fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support . Equipped with a Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction and a Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly from mountain paths to city streets.', 'Explore SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Antelope Brown, Pale Ice Green & Mushroom Brown. Features GORE-TEX waterproofing, SensiFit™ for secure fit, and Mud Contagrip® traction for all-terrain use.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, Antelope Brown trail shoes, waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX sneakers, unisex outdoor shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip', 'Antelope Brown Pale Ice Green Mushroom Brown', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Antelope Brown Pale Ice Green Mushroom Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (93, 'SALOMON XT-6 Dark Grey', '1761829607201.jpg#1761829609188.jpg#1761829611328.jpg#1761829613598.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Dark Grey XT-6 carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh</strong>, combined with a highly durable TPU film , for a lightweight and durable build. An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Agile Chassis System)</strong> chassis offers reliable stability and support . The outsole employs reliable rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern provides effective slip resistance and grip on challenging terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure ; a dedicated pocket on the tongue stores the excess lace. The molded sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide excellent cushioning and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-10-30 21:07:28.741213', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Dark Grey blends a rugged trail heritage with versatile urban style . Its durable and breathable mesh upper ensures a lightweight and comfortable wearing experience . The shoe integrates the SensiFit™ system for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain . Equipped with a reliable outsole for traction and a Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly from city streets to mountain paths.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Dark Grey. Features a durable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and reliable traction for versatile performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Dark Grey trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, breathable mesh, Quicklace', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Dark Grey\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Dark Grey\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (94, 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX Brown', '1762169367164.jpg#1762169369304.jpg#1762169371432.jpg#1762169373516.jpg#1762169375593.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Brown XT-6 GTX carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper combines a <strong>highly durable TPU film with breathable mesh</strong> and integrates <strong>GORE-TEX® technology</strong> for waterproof protection in changeable weather . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . The lightweight and durable <strong>ACS (Agile Chassis System)</strong> chassis provides reliable stability and support . The <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> outsole technology, with its unique lug pattern, delivers reliable traction and slip resistance on wet or rugged terrain .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-03 19:30:37.393939', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Brown merges trail performance with urban versatility. Featuring a GORE-TEX membrane for weather protection and durable mesh construction. SensiFit™ ensures precise lockdown while the Agile Chassis System provides stability. Mud Contagrip® outsole delivers reliable traction across varied terrain. Quicklace™ system enables effortless adjustment. Ideal for mountain trails and city streets.', 'Discover SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Brown. Features GORE-TEX waterproofing, SensiFit™ for secure fit, and Mud Contagrip® traction. Perfect for trails and urban use.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, Brown trail shoes, waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX sneakers, unisex outdoor shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Mud Contagrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX \'Brown\' - Unisex Waterproof Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (95, 'SALOMON XT-6 Beige Brown', '1762170877529.jpg#1762170879886.jpg#1762170882271.jpg#1762170884614.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Beige Brown XT-6 carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>technical synthetic mesh</strong> with <strong>TPU overlays</strong> for a lightweight build that offers support and protection . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . The <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis helps guide the foot, offering reliable stability on challenging terrain . The outsole employs reliable rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern provides effective slip resistance and grip on challenging terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure . The molded sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> (some versions feature <strong>EnergyCell™</strong> technology) work together to provide excellent cushioning and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-03 19:55:24.520184', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Beige Brown merges professional trail heritage with versatile urban style . Its technical mesh and synthetic upper ensure lightweight comfort and durability . The shoe integrates the SensiFit™ system for a secure fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support . Equipped with a reliable outsole for traction and a Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly from city streets to mountain paths.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Beige Brown. Features a durable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and reliable traction for versatile performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Beige Brown trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, breathable mesh, Quicklace', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Beige Brown\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Beige Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (96, 'SALOMON XT-6 FT Black', '1762171691743.jpg#1762171694140.jpg#1762171696581.jpg#1762171698663.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Men\'s Black XT-6 FT carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant textile</strong> for a lightweight and durable build . An internal structure helps secure the foot for a stable, wrapped feel.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology delivers a secure, comfortable, and precise fit . The outsole employs reliable rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern provides effective slip resistance and grip on challenging terrain .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure . The molded sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide excellent cushioning and long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from urban commuting to outdoor activities, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-03 20:08:53.565086', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 FT in Black merges rugged trail capability with versatile urban style for men . Its durable textile upper ensures a lightweight and comfortable wearing experience . The shoe integrates the SensiFit™ system for a secure, precise fit and stable support on varied terrain . Equipped with a reliable outsole for effective traction and the Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment , it transitions seamlessly from city streets to mountain paths.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 FT in Black for men. Features a durable textile upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and reliable traction for versatile performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6 FT, Black trail shoes, men\'s running sneakers, SensiFit, durable textile, Quicklace', 'SALOMON XT-6 FT \'Black\' - Men\'s Trail Running Shoes', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (97, 'SALOMON XT-6 Black Brown', '1762172172238.jpg#1762172174498.jpg#1762172177013.jpg#1762172190152.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Black Brown XT-6 carries the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, skillfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics. The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant and breathable mesh</strong>, combined with a highly durable TPU film, for a lightweight and durable build. An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit. The lightweight yet robust <strong>ACS (Advanced Chassis System)</strong> chassis offers reliable stability and support. The outsole employs reliable rubber technology, whose unique lug pattern provides effective slip resistance and grip on challenging terrain.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy adjustment and secure closure; a dedicated pocket on the tongue stores the excess lace. The molded sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide excellent cushioning and long-lasting underfoot comfort. Ready to transition from mountain paths to urban streets, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-03 20:17:52.378769', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Black Brown merges rugged trail heritage with versatile urban style. Its durable mesh and synthetic upper ensure lightweight comfort and long-lasting wear. The shoe integrates the SensiFit™ system for a secure, precise fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) for stable support on varied terrain. Equipped with a reliable outsole for effective traction and the Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment, it transitions seamlessly from city streets to mountain paths.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Black Brown. Features a durable mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and reliable traction for versatile performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Black Brown trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, breathable mesh, Quicklace', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Black Brown\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (98, 'SALOMON XT-6 Black', '1762172810695.jpg#1762172812943.jpg#1762172815282.jpg#1762172817470.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Black XT-6 features the iconic streamlined low-top silhouette, masterfully blending outdoor functionality with urban aesthetics . The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant polyester mesh</strong> combined with a durable TPU film for a lightweight and sturdy build . An internal sleeve secures the foot in place, enhancing the wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, delivering a secure, comfortable, and custom-like fit . The <strong>Agile Chassis System (ACS)</strong> chassis helps guide foot movement, offering reliable stability on challenging terrain . The outsole employs grippy rubber material with a unique lug pattern to improve slip resistance, adapting to both trails and urban surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In daily use, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for one-handed adjustment and easy wearability; a built-in lace pocket keeps excess cord tidy . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the <strong>soft, shock-absorbing EVA midsole</strong> work together to provide exceptional cushioning, breathability, and long-lasting comfort . Ready to transition from mountain training to city commuting, this shoe adapts effortlessly to diverse scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-03 20:27:46.153830', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Black blends rugged outdoor performance with urban versatility . Its durable polyester mesh upper ensures lightweight comfort and breathability for all-day wear . The shoe integrates the SensiFit™ system for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System (ACS) to provide stable support across varied terrain . With a reliable outsole offering strong traction and the Quicklace™ system for effortless adjustment , it transitions smoothly from trail paths to city streets.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Black. Features a durable polyester mesh upper with SensiFit™ for a secure fit and reliable traction for versatile performance.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Black trail shoes, unisex running sneakers, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, breathable mesh, Quicklace', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Black\' - Unisex Trail Running & Lifestyle Sneakers', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (99, 'Ray BEAMS x SALOMON XT-6  Purple Silver', '1762173701796.jpg#1762173704678.jpg#1762173707195.jpg#1762173709520.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This collaborative XT-6 from Ray BEAMS and SALOMON, presented in a distinctive Purple Silver colorway, merges outdoor technical aesthetics with urban fashion sensibilities . The upper combines a <strong>highly durable TPU film with breathable mesh</strong> and integrates <strong>GORE-TEX® technology</strong> for waterproof protection in changeable weather conditions . An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology . The outsole utilizes rubber technology designed to enhance downhill performance, with its unique lug pattern aiding in effective grip on challenging surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure . A dedicated pocket on the tongue stores the excess lace, enhancing overall neatness and convenience . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready to transition from urban commuting to light trail training, this collaborative shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-03 20:47:18.533096', 0, 3, 50, 'The Ray BEAMS x SALOMON XT-6 \'Purple Silver\' unisex shoe blends outdoor performance with urban style. It features a GORE-TEX® waterproof upper, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and an Agile Chassis System™ for stability on varied terrain. The Quicklace™ system offers easy adjustment, making it a versatile choice for both city commuting and trail running.', 'Discover the Ray BEAMS x SALOMON XT-6 in Purple Silver. These collaborative waterproof shoes feature GORE-TEX construction, SensiFit for a secure fit, and are perfect for trail running.', 'Ray BEAMS SALOMON XT-6, Purple Silver trail shoes, collaborative sneakers, GORE-TEX waterproof, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Quicklace, Beamssalomon联名', 'Ray BEAMS x SALOMON XT-6 \'Purple Silver\' - Collaborative Waterproof Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Purple Silver\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (100, 'SALOMON XT-6 Blue Yellow', '1762174780251.jpg#1762174782853.jpg#1762174785089.jpg#1762174788158.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a vibrant Blue Yellow colorway, strikes a balance between outdoor functionality and daily wear. The upper combines durable materials with breathable mesh to keep feet comfortable. An internal fit sleeve helps lock the foot in place for a stable, wrapped feel.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, delivering a precise, all-around wrap. The shoe is built with the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology to tackle varied terrain, offering reliable stability and excellent shock absorption. The outsole employs a grip-focused rubber compound, with its unique lug pattern enhancing traction on challenging ground.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy on-and-off and effortless adjustment, while a dedicated pocket on the tongue keeps the lace secure and the look clean. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner works in concert with the cushioned midsole to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort. Ready for light trail running as well as urban commuting, this shoe is a versatile choice for diverse scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-03 21:00:00.147269', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 Blue Yellow is a versatile shoe for trail running and urban wear. Featuring SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability. Includes ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning, Quicklace™ system, and grippy outsole. With OrthoLite® comfort, it transitions seamlessly from trails to city.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Blue Yellow. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit, Agile Chassis System for stability, and are perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Blue Yellow trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Quicklace, Agile Chassis System, comfortable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Blue Yellow\' - Comfortable Low-Top Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Blue Yellow\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (101, 'SALOMON XT-6 Black/Green', '1762176049559.jpg#1762176120808.jpg#1762176123468.jpg#1762176125660.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, presented in a Black and Green colorway, blends outdoor functionality with urban style. The upper combines durable materials with breathable mesh for support and comfort.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit. To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology. The outsole utilizes <strong>Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology designed for enhanced traction, with its unique lug pattern aiding in effective grip on challenging surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort. Ready to transition from urban commuting to light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-03 21:22:43.058775', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Black and Green is a versatile shoe built for reliable performance. It features the SensiFit™ system for a secure, glove-like fit and the Agile Chassis System™ for stability on varied terrain. Lightweight ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning provides shock absorption. The practical Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment and secure closure. With a durable outsole for dependable traction and a comfortable OrthoLite® sockliner, this shoe transitions seamlessly from outdoor trails to city.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Black Green. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit, Agile Chassis System for stability, and are perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Black Green trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, durable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Black Green\' - Comfortable Durable Low-Top Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Black Green\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (102, 'SALOMON XT-6 Green', '1762257378228.jpg#1762257380046.jpg#1762257382195.jpg#1762257384549.jpg#1762257387075.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a Green colorway, seamlessly blends outdoor functionality with urban style. The upper combines durable materials with breathable mesh for support and comfort .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis &nbsp;and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology . The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, with its unique lug pattern designed to enhance slip resistance and provide effective grip on challenging surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner works in concert with the cushioned midsole to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort and breathability . Ready for long-distance trail running as well as urban commuting, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 19:57:29.182926', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Green delivers versatile performance for trail running and urban wear. This unisex shoe features SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability on varied terrain. With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning for shock absorption and a durable Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable grip. The Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment while the OrthoLite® sockliner provides lasting comfort. Perfect for transitioning from mountain trails to city streets.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Green. These unisex trail running shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability, perfect for both outdoor trails and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Green trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, durable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Green\' - Comfortable Durable Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Green\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (103, 'SALOMON XT-6 Rubber Color', '1762257682169.jpg#1762257684360.jpg#1762257687566.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a Rubber colorway, blends outdoor functionality with urban style. The upper utilizes durable <strong>polyester fabric</strong> for support and comfort .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology . The outsole employs <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, with its unique lug pattern designed to enhance grip on challenging surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure, with a dedicated pocket on the tongue for neat lace storage . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner works in concert with the cushioned midsole to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort and breathability . Ready for urban commuting as well as light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:02:27.469976', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Rubber Color delivers versatile performance for trail and urban wear. This men\'s model features SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability on varied terrain. With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning for shock absorption and durable Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction. The Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment while the OrthoLite® sockliner provides comfort. This durable polyester-built shoe seamlessly bridges trails and city.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Rubber Color. These men\'s shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit, Agile Chassis System for stability, and are perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Rubber Color trail shoes, men\'s running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, durable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Rubber Color\' - Durable Low-Top Trail Running Shoes (Men)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Rubber Color\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (104, 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX Blue', '1762258188370.jpg#1762258190652.jpg#1762258192940.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6 GTX, presented in a Blue colorway, merges outdoor technical aesthetics with urban fashion sensibilities. The upper combines synthetic materials and textile mesh, and integrates <strong>GORE-TEX®</strong> technology for waterproof and breathable protection in changeable weather conditions. An internal sleeve helps secure the foot in the correct position for a stable, wrapped feel.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit. To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology. The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, with its unique lug pattern aiding in effective grip on challenging surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure. A dedicated pocket on the tongue stores the excess lace, enhancing overall neatness and convenience. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort. Ready to transition from urban commuting to light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:11:04.484098', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Blue seamlessly blends trail performance with urban style. This unisex shoe features GORE-TEX® waterproof protection and SensiFit™ for a secure fit. The Agile Chassis System™ ensures stability while ENERGYCELL™+ provides responsive cushioning. With a Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction and Quicklace™ system for easy adjustment. Perfect for all-weather trail running and city commuting.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Blue. These unisex waterproof shoes feature GORE-TEX construction, SensiFit™ for a secure fit, and are perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, Blue trail shoes, GORE-TEX waterproof, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Quicklace, Mud Contagrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX \'Blue\' - Waterproof Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Blue\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (105, 'SALOMON XT-6 Blue', '1762258633089.jpg#1762258635329.jpg#1762258637612.jpg#1762258640419.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a Blue colorway, blends retro style with modern functionality. The upper combines durable materials with breathable mesh for support and comfort.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit. To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology. The outsole utilizes rubber technology designed for enhanced traction, with its unique lug pattern aiding in effective grip on challenging surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure. The molded sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort. Ready for urban commuting as well as light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:18:07.840066', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Blue combines retro style with modern performance. This unisex shoe features the SensiFit™ system for a secure fit and the Agile Chassis System™ for stability on varied terrain. Lightweight ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning provides responsive shock absorption. The practical Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment and secure closure. With a durable outsole for dependable traction and a comfortable build, this versatile shoe transitions seamlessly from outdoor trails to city streets.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Blue. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit, Agile Chassis System for stability, and are perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Blue trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, retro sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Blue\' - Retro Comfortable Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Blue\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (106, 'SALOMON XT-6 Moss Green', '1762258848021.jpg#1762258850551.jpg#1762258852928.jpg#1762258856334.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a Moss Green colorway, perfectly blends outdoor functionality with daily wear needs. The upper combines durable materials with breathable mesh for excellent support and comfort.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, providing complete foot wrapping and precise fit. The shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology, delivering reliable stability and excellent shock protection on challenging terrain. The outsole uses high-traction rubber technology with unique lug patterns for superior grip on rugged surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy wearing and adjustment. The molded sockliner works in concert with the cushioned midsole to deliver long-lasting comfort. Suitable for both trail training and urban commuting, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:22:30.636592', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Moss Green offers versatile trail-to-city performance. Featuring SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability. With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning for shock absorption and durable outsole for traction. The Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment. This unisex shoe seamlessly bridges outdoor adventures and urban commuting.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Moss Green. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability, perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Moss Green trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, comfortable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Moss Green\' - Comfortable Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Moss Green\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (107, 'SALOMON XT-6 Orange', '1762259149849.jpg#1762259152047.jpg#1762259154632.jpg#1762259156663.jpg#1762259159055.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in an Orange colorway, blends outdoor functionality with daily sports needs. The upper combines <strong>durable fabric</strong> with breathable mesh for support and comfort 。</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit 。 To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology 。 The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, with its unique lug pattern designed to enhance grip on challenging surfaces 。</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure 。 The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort 。 Ready for urban commuting as well as light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:26:44.705951', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Orange offers versatile trail-to-city performance. It features SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability . With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning for shock absorption  and Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction . The Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment . This unisex shoe seamlessly bridges outdoor adventures and urban commuting.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Orange. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit, Agile Chassis System for stability, and are perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Orange trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, durable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Orange\' - Comfortable Durable Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Orange\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (108, 'SALOMON XT-6 Ebony', '1762259360102.jpg#1762259362590.jpg#1762259365134.jpg#1762259367177.jpg#1762259369536.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in an Ebony colorway, blends retro style with modern outdoor functionality. The upper combines durable materials with breathable mesh for support and comfort 。</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit 。 To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology 。 The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, with its unique lug pattern designed to enhance grip on challenging surfaces 。</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure, with a dedicated pocket on the tongue for neat lace storage 。 The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort and breathability 。 Ready for urban commuting as well as light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:30:13.623397', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Ebony combines retro style with modern performance. It features SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability . With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning for shock absorption  and Mud Contagrip® outsole for reliable traction . The Quicklace™ system allows easy adjustment . This versatile shoe transitions seamlessly from trails to city.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Ebony. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit, Agile Chassis System for stability, and are perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Ebony trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, Mud Contagrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Ebony\' - Retro Slip-Resistant Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Ebony\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (109, 'SALOMON XT-6 Chocolate', '1762259641165.jpg#1762259644993.jpg#1762259647637.jpg#1762259649590.jpg#1762259652278.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6 \"Twilight\" series, featured in a Chocolate colorway, blends outdoor functionality with retro urban style . The upper combines <strong>durable fabric</strong> with breathable mesh for support and comfort .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology . The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, with its unique lug pattern designed to enhance grip on challenging surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready for urban commuting as well as light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios .</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:37:11.433776', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 Chocolate combines retro style with outdoor performance. It features SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability . With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning and Mud Contagrip® outsole for shock absorption and traction . The Quicklace™ system allows easy adjustment . This versatile shoe bridges trails and city streets.', 'Explore the SALOMON XT-6 in Chocolate from the Twilight series. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability, perfect for trail running and city walking.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Chocolate trail shoes, Twilight series, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, retro sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Chocolate\' Twilight - Retro Outdoor Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Chocolate\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (110, 'SALOMON XT-6  Gray', '1762260009552.jpg#1762260012128.jpg#1762260014551.jpg#1762260016915.jpg#1762260019678.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a Gray colorway, blends sports functionality with daily wear needs. The upper combines <strong>durable fabric</strong> with breathable mesh for excellent support and comfort.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, providing complete foot wrapping and precise fit. The shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology, delivering reliable stability and excellent shock protection on challenging terrain. The outsole uses <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology with unique lug patterns for superior grip on rugged surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy wearing and adjustment. The molded sockliner works in concert with the cushioned midsole to deliver long-lasting comfort. Suitable for both daily running and urban commuting, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:41:10.569278', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Gray offers versatile performance for urban and trail use. Featuring SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability . With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning for shock absorption and Mud Contagrip® outsole for traction . The Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment . This durable shoe bridges city commuting and outdoor running.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Gray. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability, perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Gray trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, durable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Gray\' - Comfortable Durable Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Gray\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (111, 'SALOMON XT-6 Cathay Spice Brown', '1762260282366.jpg#1762260284640.jpg#1762260287142.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6 \"Cathay Spice\", featured in a Brown colorway, blends outdoor functionality with daily wear needs. The upper uses <strong>abrasion-resistant mesh</strong> for support and breathability .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology . The outsole utilizes rubber technology designed for enhanced traction, with its unique lug pattern aiding in effective grip on challenging surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the traditional lacing system allows for personalized adjustment and a secure closure. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort and breathability . Ready for urban commuting as well as light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:45:24.862574', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 \"Cathay Spice\" in Brown offers versatile trail-to-city performance. It features SensiFit™ for a secure fit  and Agile Chassis System™ for stability . With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning for shock absorption  and a durable outsole for traction . This lace-up shoe seamlessly bridges outdoor adventures and urban commuting.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 \"Cathay Spice\" in Brown. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability, perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Cathay Spice, Brown trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, durable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Cathay Spice Brown\' - Durable Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"$99\",\"value\":\"Cathay Spice Brown\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (112, 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX Blue Black', '1762260469944.jpg#1762260471772.jpg#1762260473873.jpg#1762260475898.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6 GTX, featured in a Blue Black colorway, blends outdoor waterproof functionality with urban daily wear. The upper incorporates <strong>GORE-TEX®</strong> technology that effectively blocks water penetration while maintaining breathability, keeping feet dry and comfortable in adverse weather conditions.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, delivering precise wrapping. The <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis provides reliable stability on various terrains, combined with lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology that effectively absorbs impact. The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology with unique lug patterns that deliver excellent slip resistance on wet surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system enables easy wearing and adjustment. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner works in concert with the cushioned midsole to provide long-lasting comfort. Suitable for rainy day commuting as well as trail training, this shoe performs reliably in multiple scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:48:57.362273', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Blue Black offers waterproof all-weather performance. Featuring GORE-TEX® protection and SensiFit™ for a secure fit . With Agile Chassis System™ for stability and ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning . The durable Mud Contagrip® outsole ensures traction, while the Quicklace™ system allows easy adjustment for trails and city.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 GTX in Blue Black. These waterproof shoes feature GORE-TEX technology and SensiFit™ for a secure fit, perfect for all-weather trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX, Blue Black, waterproof running shoes, GORE-TEX, trail shoes, unisex, SensiFit, Mud Contagrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 GTX \'Blue Black\' - Waterproof Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Blue Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (113, 'SALOMON XT-6 Red Black', '1762260646886.jpg#1762260648965.jpg#1762260651065.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a Red Black colorway, blends outdoor functionality with daily wear needs. The upper combines durable materials with breathable mesh for support and comfort .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit . To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology . The outsole utilizes <strong>Mud Contagrip®</strong> rubber technology, with its unique lug pattern designed to enhance grip on challenging surfaces .</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure, with a dedicated pocket on the tongue for neat lace storage . The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort . Ready for urban commuting as well as light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-04 20:51:41.408647', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Red Black delivers versatile trail-to-city performance. It features SensiFit™ for a secure fit  and Agile Chassis System™ for stability . With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning  and Mud Contagrip® outsole for traction . The Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment . This shoe bridges outdoor adventures and urban commuting.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Red Black. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit, Agile Chassis System for stability, and are perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Red Black trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, Mud Contagrip', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Red Black\' - Comfortable Slip-Resistant Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Red Black\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (114, 'SALOMON XT-6 Green', '1762428652461.jpg#1762428655420.jpg#1762428658039.jpg#1762428660677.jpg#1762428663645.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a Green colorway, blends outdoor functionality with daily wear needs. The upper combines <strong>durable fabric</strong> with breathable mesh for support and comfort.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, wrapping the entire foot for a superior, precise fit. To provide reliable stability and excellent shock absorption on varied terrain, the shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology. The outsole utilizes rubber technology designed for enhanced traction, with its unique lug pattern aiding in effective grip on challenging surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for effortless tightening and secure closure, with a dedicated pocket on the tongue for neat lace storage. The molded <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner and the cushioned midsole work together to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort and breathability. Ready for urban commuting as well as light trail training, this shoe adapts effortlessly to various daily scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-06 19:31:53.133440', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in Green offers versatile trail-to-city performance. It features SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability. With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning for shock absorption and a durable outsole for traction. The Quicklace™ system ensures easy adjustment. This unisex shoe seamlessly bridges outdoor adventures and urban commuting.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in Green. These unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System for stability, perfect for trail running and city commuting.', 'SALOMON XT-6, Green trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, Quicklace, durable sneakers', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'Green\' - Comfortable Durable Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Green\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
INSERT INTO `b_thing` VALUES (115, 'SALOMON XT-6 White', '1762429059281.jpg#1762429061700.jpg#1762429064020.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: start;\">This SALOMON XT-6, featured in a pure White colorway, perfectly blends fashion with functionality. The upper combines durable rubber mudguards with breathable mesh for excellent support and comfort.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">For core performance, the <strong>SensiFit™</strong> technology extends from the midsole to the lacing system, providing complete foot wrapping and precise fit. The shoe features the <strong>Agile Chassis System™</strong> chassis and incorporates lightweight <strong>ENERGYCELL™+</strong> cushioning technology, delivering reliable stability and excellent shock protection on challenging terrain. The outsole uses anti-slip rubber technology with unique tread patterns for reliable traction on wet surfaces.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">In terms of wearing experience, the <strong>Quicklace™</strong> quick-pull system allows for easy wearing and adjustment. The molded sockliner works in concert with the cushioned midsole to deliver long-lasting comfort. Suitable for both daily wear and light trail activities, this shoe performs well in various scenarios.</p>', '$99', '0', '2025-11-06 19:38:25.260679', 0, 3, 50, 'The SALOMON XT-6 in White blends style with performance. Featuring SensiFit™ for a secure fit and Agile Chassis System™ for stability. With ENERGYCELL™+ cushioning and durable rubber outsole for shock absorption and traction. The Quicklace™ system allows easy adjustment. Perfect for urban and trail use.', 'Discover the SALOMON XT-6 in White. These stylish unisex shoes feature SensiFit™ for a secure fit and are perfect for both trail running and urban fashion.', 'SALOMON XT-6, White trail shoes, unisex running shoes, SensiFit, Agile Chassis System, white sneakers, stylish running shoes', 'SALOMON XT-6 \'White\' - Comfortable & Stylish Trail Running Shoes (Unisex)', '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"White\"}]', 'Recommend,Feature');
